# The frontend has no required environment variables: it always calls the
# relative path `/api/v1/...`, and whichever server is in front of it resolves
# that to the backend — Vite's dev proxy locally (see vite.config.ts), or the
# Nginx config baked into the production image (see docker/frontend.Dockerfile
# and docker/nginx.conf) when running via Docker.
#
# This file exists so the pattern described in the build spec is followed even
# though there is currently nothing that needs overriding.
